{"id":"fc33254b6c0f298f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-transport.md","title":"沿本书相等的代换","display":"df-transport — 沿本书相等的代换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-transport","aliases":["16-df-transport","Transport along identity","16-transport"],"display":"df-transport — 沿本书相等的代换","depends_on":["[[16-df-identity-type]]"],"source":"Derived from §11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701), weak equality elimination and beta","review_status":"derived-from-source-rules","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-transport"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-transport</span><span>Transport along identity</span><span>16-transport</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transport — 沿本书相等的代换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Derived from §11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701), weak equality elimination and beta"},{"key":"review_status","html":"derived-from-source-rules"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a> 的弱、强或很强相等包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash P(x):\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash P(x):\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash a,b:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash a,b:A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash q:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash q:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash d:P(a)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash d:P(a)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>演算有类型的函数空间、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 和应用及其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 转换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 为相等消去表达式；下式先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,u:A,v:A,h:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(u,v)\">\\(\\Gamma,u:A,v:A,h:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(u,v)\\)</span> 中形成消去项，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a/u,b/v,q/h]\">\\([a/u,b/v,q/h]\\)</span> 代入；其分支 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda t:P(u).t\">\\(\\lambda t:P(u).t\\)</span> 位于对角上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,u:A\">\\(\\Gamma,u:A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,h,t\">\\(u,v,h,t\\)</span> 均新鲜，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(u)\\to P(v)\">\\(P(u)\\to P(v)\\)</span> 是非依赖函数类型。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 是该操作族的隐式参数；下节反身计算式取同一族的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=a\">\\(b=a\\)</span> 实例，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_A(a)\">\\(r_A(a)\\)</span> 输入的是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,a)\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,a)\\)</span> 对应分量。历史拼写采用规范相等原子的显式缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(u,v)\\coloneqq P(u)\\to P(v),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\mathsf E_{A,C(u,v)}\\bigl(\\lambda t:P(u).t;u,v,h\\bigr)\n[a/u,b/v,q/h]\\right)(d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(u,v)\\coloneqq P(u)\\to P(v),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\mathsf E_{A,C(u,v)}\\bigl(\\lambda t:P(u).t;u,v,h\\bigr)\n[a/u,b/v,q/h]\\right)(d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d):P(b),\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(r_A(a),d)\\equiv d:P(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d):P(b),\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(r_A(a),d)\\equiv d:P(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.4，pp. 680–681（PDF 700–701）的弱相等消去与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 转换；由此显式派生 transport。目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(u)\\to P(v)\">\\(P(u)\\to P(v)\\)</span> 不依赖相等证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，所以弱包已足够；不需要很强相等的 equality reflection。</li>\n<li>在对角线上分支为恒等函数；相等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 后接函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 给出计算式。此处替换了原来悬空的 intensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 构造，结果类型和计算规律保持。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-identity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的弱、强或很强相等包；$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}$，$\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash P(x):\\mathsf{Type}$，$\\Gamma\\vdash a,b:A$，$\\Gamma\\vdash q:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)$，$\\Gamma\\vdash d:P(a)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash P(x):\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash a,b:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash q:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash d:P(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,u:A,v:A,h:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"[a/u,b/v,q/h]","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda t:P(u).t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,u:A","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,h,t","display":false},{"tex":"P(u)\\to P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"b=a","display":false},{"tex":"r_A(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,a)","display":false},{"tex":"C(u,v)\\coloneqq P(u)\\to P(v),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\mathsf E_{A,C(u,v)}\\bigl(\\lambda t:P(u).t;u,v,h\\bigr)\n[a/u,b/v,q/h]\\right)(d).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(q,d):P(b),\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{transport}^{P}(r_A(a),d)\\equiv d:P(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"P(u)\\to P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":2067,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-transport|df-transport — 沿本书相等的代换]]"},{"id":"bb2b4beb1ad09944","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A,P,a,b,q,d$、相等规则包、函数类型及 $\\operatorname{transport}^{P}$ 完全采用 [[16-df-transport]] 的声明和定义。"}],"outgoing":["5c7f9132ab843c91"]}